@participant1 Thanks for your work! I pull the newest fix, and no delay show up when I use command like ls, cd, yazi.

[zellij-0.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27485588/zellij-0.log)

[zellij.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27485604/zellij.log)

Thanks everyone for the help troubleshooting and testing! I'll issue a fix followed by a patch sometime in the next week or so. For now the workaround is to stay on 0.44.1.

@participant4 - the attached logs don't show the symptoms of this issue. Could it be that you're accidentally running inside a nested Zellij session as before? Otherwise, I'd try to restart the machine completely and try again to make sure nothing interferes, make sure you're running in release mode, etc. - but since this seems fixed for everyone else I'm afraid it's very likely an environmental issue of some sort.

Happy to look further into it if it persists, but I'll need the sort of troubleshooting provided earlier in this thread and have this treated as a separate problem.
